          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तबियत — tabiyat — \"one's health; how one feels\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आज म्हारी तबियत ठीक है। āj mhārī tabiyat ṭhīk hai. I am feeling well today."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तबियत (tabiyat) is usually traced to Persian tabīat, \"nature, temperament\"; in Marwari it is how one feels in body."
            }
          ]
        },
